{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"বীজগণিত": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) যদি (x-y)&sup2; = 14 এবং xy=2 হয় তবে x&sup2;+y&sup2; = কত?", "option1": "ক) 6", "option2": "খ) 8", "option3": "গ) 12", "option4": "ঘ) 18", "answer": "4", "exp": "আমরা জানি,<br />x&sup2;+y&sup2; = (x-y)&sup2; + 2xy<br />= 14+2&times;2<br />= 18"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) (5&divide;5&times;5)/(5&divide;5 এর 5) = ?", "option1": "ক) 5", "option2": "খ) 10", "option3": "গ) 15", "option4": "ঘ) 25", "answer": "4", "exp": "According to BODMAS,<br />(5&divide;5&times;5)/(5&divide;5এর5)<br /> = (1&times;5)/(5&divide;25)<br />= 5&times;(25&divide;5) <br />= 5&times;5 <br />= 25"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) x + y =&nbsp;5 এবং xy =&nbsp;7 হলে (x-y)&sup2; এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) -3", "option2": "খ) -2", "option3": "গ) 1", "option4": "ঘ) 3", "answer": "1", "exp": "(x-y) = (x+y)&sup2; - 4xy<br />= 5&sup2;-4&times;7<br />=&nbsp;-3"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) x+y=3, x-y=1 হলে x&sup2;+y&sup2; এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 5", "option2": "খ) 10", "option3": "গ) -5", "option4": "ঘ) 13", "answer": "1", "exp": "2(x&sup2;+y&sup2;) = (x+y)&sup2;+(x-y)&sup2;<br />= 3&sup2;+ 1&sup2;<br />= 9+1<br />2(x&sup2;+y&sup2;)= 10<br />&there4; x&sup2;+y&sup2; = 10/2 <br />=5"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) 1/2{(a+b)&sup2;+(a-b)&sup2;}=কত?", "option1": "ক) a&sup2;+b&sup2;", "option2": "খ) a&sup2;-b&sup2;", "option3": "গ) (a+b)&sup2;/2", "option4": "ঘ) (a+b)&sup2;+(a-b)&sup2;", "answer": "1", "exp": "1/2{(a+b)&sup2;+(a-b)&sup2;} = &frac12;(a&sup2;+2ab+b&sup2;+a&sup2;-2ab+b&sup2;)<br />= &frac12;(2a&sup2;+2b&sup2;) = &frac12;.2(a&sup2;+b&sup2;)<br />=&nbsp;a&sup2;+b&sup2;"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) x - {a&nbsp;- (x - b)} = ?", "option1": "ক) 2x - a - b", "option2": "খ) 2x - 2a", "option3": "গ) 2a - 2b", "option4": "ঘ) x- a + b", "answer": "1", "exp": "x - {a&nbsp;- (x - b)}<br />= x - {a -x + b}<br />= x - a +x - b<br />= 2x - a - b"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) M সংখ্যক সংখ্যার গড় A এবং N সংখ্যক সংখ্যার গড় B. সব