"গ) x<sup>2</sup>-49", "option4": "ঘ) 49", "answer": "3", "exp": "আমরা জানি, (a+b)(a-b) = a<sup>2</sup>-b<sup>2</sup><br />&there4;প্রদত্ত রাশি, (x+7)(x-7)<br />=x<sup>2</sup>-7<sup>2</sup><br />=x<sup>2</sup>-49"}, {"id": "19", "question": "১৯) a = 2x-3 এবং b = 2x+5 হলে, a+b এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 4x + 4", "option2": "খ) 2(2x + 1)", "option3": "গ) 2x + 2", "option4": "ঘ) 4x + 1", "answer": "2", "exp": "দেওয়া আছে, a = 2x - 3 এবং b = 2x+5<br />&there4; a + b =&nbsp;2x - 3 +&nbsp;2x+5 <br />= 4x + 2 <br />= 2(2x + 1)"}, {"id": "20", "question": "২০) a = 2x-3 এবং b = 2x+5 হলে, a<sup>2</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 4x+12", "option2": "খ) 4x<sup>2</sup>-12x+9", "option3": "গ) 4x+12x", "option4": "ঘ) 4x<sup>2</sup>+12x+9", "answer": "2", "exp": "দেওয়া আছে, a = 2x-3<br />&there4;a<sup>2</sup> = (2x-3)<sup>2</sup><br />=(2x)<sup>2</sup>-2.2x.3+(3)<sup>2</sup><br />=4x<sup>2</sup>-12x+9"}, {"id": "21", "question": "২১) a = 2x-3, b = 2x+5 এবং x = 2 হলে ab এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 7", "option2": "খ) 9", "option3": "গ) 13", "option4": "ঘ) 17", "answer": "2", "exp": "দেওয়া আছে, a = 2x-3 এবং b = 2x+5<br />ab = (2x-3)(2x-5)<br />=(2.2-3)(2.2+5) [যেহেতু, x = 2]<br />=9"}, {"id": "22", "question": "২২) a এবং b উভয়ই বিজোড় সংখ্যা হলে কোনটি জোড় সংখ্যা হবে?", "option1": "ক) a<sup>2</sup>+b", "option2": "খ) ab", "option3": "গ) a/b", "option4": "ঘ) None of them", "answer": "1", "exp": "বেজোড় সংখ্যার বর্গ করলে সে সংখ্যাটিও বেজোড় হয় এবং যেকোনো দুইটি বেজোড় সংখ্যার যোগ করলে প্রাপ্ত যোগফল জোড় সংখ্যা হয়।"}, {"id": "23", "question": "২৩) যদি a+b = &radic;5 এবং a - b = &radic;3 হয় , তবে (a&sup2;+b&sup2;) = কত?", "option1": "ক) 2", "option2": "খ) 4", "option3": "গ) 8", "option4": "ঘ) 16", "answer": "2", "exp": "2(a&sup2;+b&sup2;) <br />= (a+b)&sup2; + (a - b)&sup2; <br />= (&radic;5)&sup2; + (&radic;3)&sup2; <br />= 8 &rArr; (a&sup2;+b&sup2;) <br />= 8/2 <br />= 4"}, {"id": "24", "question": "২৪) a<sup>2</sup>-2ab+b<sup>2</sup> কে a-b দ্বারা গুণ করলে গুণফল কত হবে?", "option1": "ক) a<sup>3</sup>-3a<sup>3</sup>b + 3ab<sup>2</sup>-b<sup>2</sup>", "option2": "খ) a<sup>3</sup>-3a<sup>3</sup>b + 3ab<sup>2</sup>-b<sup>3</sup>", "option3": "গ) a<sup>3</sup>-3a<sup>3</sup>b + 3ab<sup>3</sup>-b<sup>3</sup>", "option4": "ঘ) a<sup>3</sup>-3a<sup>2</sup>b + 3ab<sup>2</sup>-b<sup>3</sup>", "answer": "4", "exp": "(a<sup>2</sup>-2ab+b<sup>2</sup>)(a-b)<br />= a(a<sup>2</sup>-2ab+b<sup>2</sup>) - b(a<sup>2</sup>-2ab+b<sup>2</sup>) <br />= a<sup>3</sup>-2a<sup>2</sup>b+ab<sup>2</sup>-a<sup>2</sup>b+2ab<sup>2</sup>-b<sup>3</sup><br />=a<sup>3</sup>-3a<sup>2</sup>b + 3ab<sup>2</sup>-b<sup>3</sup>"}, {"id": "25", "question": "২৫) x<sup>3</sup>+x<sup>2</sup>y , x<sup>2</sup>y+xy<sup>2</sup> রাশিদ্বয়ের ল.সা.গু নির্ণয় করো।", "option1": "ক) x<sup>2</sup>y(x+y)", "option2": "খ) x<sup>2</sup>y<sup>2</sup>(x+y)", "option3": "গ) xy<sup>2</sup>(x+y)", "option4": "ঘ) xy(x+y)<sup>2</sup>", "answer": "1", "exp": "১ম রাশি= x<sup>3</sup>+x<sup>2</sup>y=x<sup>2</sup>(x+y) <br />২য় রাশি= x<sup>2</sup>y+xy<sup>2</sup>=xy(x+y) <br />&there4;ল.সা.গু =x<sup>2</sup>y(x+y)"}, {"id": "26", "question": "২৬) 2a² - 4ab + 4b² থেকে কত যোগ বা বিয়োগ করলে তা একটি পূর্ণ বর্গ হবে?\r\n", "option1": "ক) 2a² যোগ করলে", "option2": "খ) 2b² বিয়োগ করলে", "option3": "গ) a² বিয়োগ করলে", "option4": "ঘ) 2ab যোগ করলে", "answer": "0", "exp": "<p><strong>প্রশ্ন: 2a<sup>2</sup> - 4ab + 4b<sup>2</sup> রাশিটির সাথে কত যোগ বা বিয়োগ করলে রাশিটি একটি পূর্ণ বর্গ হবে? </strong><br><br><strong>অপশনে দ্বৈত উত্তর থাকায় প্রশ্নটি বাতিল করা হলো।</strong><br>----------------<br><strong>সমাধান: </strong><br>প্রদত্ত রাশি = 2a<sup>2</sup> - 4ab + 4b<sup>2</sup> <br>= a<sup>2</sup> + a<sup>2</sup> - 4ab + 4b<sup>2</sup> <br>= a<sup>2</sup> - 2.a.2b + (2b)<sup>2</sup> + a<sup>2</sup> <br>= (a - 2b)<sup>2</sup> + a<sup>2</sup> <br><br>∴ a<sup>2</sup> বিয়োগ করলে যোগফল পূর্ণ বর্গ হবে।<br>---------------------------------<br>2a<sup>2</sup> - 4ab + 4b<sup>2</sup> <br>= 2a<sup>2</sup> - 4ab + 2b<sup>2</sup> + 2b<sup>2</sup><br>= (√2a)<sup>2</sup> - 2.√2a.√2b + (√2b)<sup>2</sup>  + 2b<sup>2</sup><br>= (√2a - √2b)<sup>2</sup> + 2b<sup>2</sup> <br><br>2a<sup>2</sup> - 4ab + 4b<sup>2</sup> রাশিটি থেকে 2b<sup>2</sup> বিয়োগ করলে রাশিটি একটি পূর্ণ বর্গ হবে।</p>"}, {"id": "27", "question": "২৭) x/y এর সাথে কত যোগ করলে y/x হবে?", "option1": "ক) (y-x)<sup>2</sup>/xy", "option2": "খ) (y-x)<sup>2</sup>/xy<sup>2</sup>", "option3": "গ) (y-x)/xy<sup>2</sup>", "option4": "ঘ) (y<sup>2</sup>-x<sup>2</sup>)/xy", "answer": "4", "exp": "y/x - x/y<br />= (y<sup>2</sup>-x<sup>2</sup>)/xy"}, {"id": "28", "question": "২৮) a + b = 7 এবং ab = 10 হলে, (a &ndash; b)<sup>2</sup> এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 7", "option2": "খ) 9", "option3": "গ) 12", "option4": "ঘ) 70", "answer": "2", "exp": "(a &ndash; b)<sup>2</sup> <br />= (a + b)<sup>2</sup> &ndash; 4ab<br />=(7)<sup>2</sup> &ndash; 4 &times; 10<br />= 49 &ndash; 40 = 9"}, {"id": "29", "question": "২৯) &radic;2/(&radic;6+2) = ?", "option1": "ক) &nbsp;&radic;3 - &radic;2", "option2": "খ) &nbsp;&radic;2 - &radic;3", "option3": "গ) &nbsp;&radic;3 / &radic;2", "option4": "ঘ) &nbsp;&radic;3 + &radic;2", "answer": "1", "exp": "&radic;2/(&radic;6+2) <br />=&nbsp;&radic;2 /{&radic;2 (&nbsp;&radic;3 +&nbsp;&radic;2 )}<br />= 1/(&nbsp;&radic;3 +&nbsp;&radic;2 ) <br />=(&nbsp;&radic;3 -&nbsp;&radic;2 )/3-2 [লব ও হর উভয়কে &radic;3 -&nbsp;&radic;2 দ্বারা গুণ] <br />=&nbsp;(&nbsp;&radic;3 -&nbsp;&radic;2 )/1 <br />=&nbsp;&radic;3 - &radic;2"}, {"id": "30", "question": "৩০) a-{a-(a+1)}= কত?", "option1": "ক) a-1", "option2": "খ) 1", "option3": "গ) a", "option4": "ঘ) a+1", "answer": "4", "exp": "a-{a-(a+1)} <br />= a-{a-a-1} <br />= a+1"}]}, "exam_time": 1800000, "pk": 1390, "is_omr": false, "omr_time": 7200000, "is_mapping": false, "question_mapping": {}, "_source": "exam-view", "_exam_id": 1390}